    "basis": "traditional",
    "detail": "Anonymous Irish highwayman ballad, in oral circulation and printed on Dublin and London broadsides well before 1900; no identifiable author.",
    "sourceEdition": "Traditional broadside setting in G major; encoded from the common session/ballad version, no modern arrangement consulted.",
    "notes": "Melody and harmony only, no lyrics. Famous today through 20th-century band arrangements (each of which is separately copyrighted as an arrangement); this file carries the traditional tune and the plain traditional changes only."
